Replace-From: Yang Xiwen <forbidden405@outlook.com>
Replace-Date: Sat, 24 Feb 2024 01:09:19 +0800
Subject: dt-bindings: clock: document the Hi3798MV200 CRG in YAML

The Hi3798MV200 is similar to the Hi3798CV200 and needs its own
compatibles in the schema.
Add them to hisilicon,hisi-crg.yaml; the clock id headers come with the
driver block.
The in-tree sysctrl nodes are written as "<soc>-sysctrl", "syscon"
while the CRG nodes add "simple-mfd", so the oneOf carries both forms
and the poplar board keeps validating.

Acked-by: Rob Herring <robh@kernel.org>
Signed-off-by: Yang Xiwen <forbidden405@outlook.com>
Signed-off-by: David Yang <mmyangfl@gmail.com>
 1 file changed, 11 insertions(+), 0 deletions(-)


diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/clock/hisilicon,hisi-crg.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/clock/hisilicon,hisi-crg.yaml
index 19c0ce8815df..bf98851b4636 100644
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/clock/hisilicon,hisi-crg.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/clock/hisilicon,hisi-crg.yaml
@@ -22,6 +22,7 @@
               - hisilicon,hi3516cv300-sysctrl
               - hisilicon,hi3798cv200-sysctrl
               - hisilicon,hi3798mv100-sysctrl
+              - hisilicon,hi3798mv200-sysctrl
           - const: syscon
       - items:
           - enum:
@@ -29,8 +30,18 @@
               - hisilicon,hi3716cv200-crg
               - hisilicon,hi3798cv200-crg
               - hisilicon,hi3798mv100-crg
+              - hisilicon,hi3798mv200-crg
           - const: syscon
           - const: simple-mfd
+      - items:
+          - enum:
+              - hisilicon,hi3516cv300-crg
+              - hisilicon,hi3516cv300-sysctrl
+              - hisilicon,hi3798cv200-crg
+              - hisilicon,hi3798cv200-sysctrl
+              - hisilicon,hi3798mv200-crg
+              - hisilicon,hi3798mv200-sysctrl
+          - const: syscon
 
   reg:
     maxItems: 1
